name: Sprott F
family: Flows
desc: One of J. C. Sprott's 19 simplest chaotic flows (case F) — five terms, one or two nonlinearities.
ref: J. C. Sprott, "Some simple chaotic flows", Phys. Rev. E 50 (1994)
tags: flow, sprott, 3d
dt: 0.02
ic: 0.1 0.1 0.1
camera: 25 20 0 1

param a = 0.5 [0.1, 1]
param b = 1.0 [0.5, 2]

dx = y + z
dy = -x + a*y
dz = x^2 - b*z
